MDS_MAIN.pdf
MDS_SUP.pdf

# Pre-reorganisation originals at the repository root, kept on disk for reference only.
# The two notebooks are 39 MB and 103 MB, almost entirely embedded output images, and the
# 103 MB one is over GitHub's per-file hard limit. Their content now lives, split by
# figure, in notebooks/ and R_scripts/.
/MDS_manuscript_figures.ipynb
/MDS_REVIEW_COMMENTS.ipynb
/mds_xenium_viz.R

# Earlier, partial organising passes kept on disk for reference. Superseded by
